WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
vAntah.
My take on a Linux operating system.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
I love the macOS style.
I wanted a system I could change.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Install an app.
Use it right from the terminal.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A Finder-inspired Files app.
For the work I actually do.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Write. Edit. Save.
A system I can make my own.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Glass. Settings. Arabic.
Built on Alpine Linux.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Up-to-code/vantah
The source is on GitHub.
